Iridite Mutual is a bank in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. It issues bank cards, and its headquarters keeps an automagic teller machine behind the heaviest guard in the city. [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Hlarf|Hlarf]] carried one of its cards, and [[Smiler]] drew the money out of it for a cut.
